items.body:
When looking at https://github.com/yaml/pyyaml, GH just presents the file list and a bunch of things but getting to the docs site means scrolling to the very bottom.

This is especially painful when one has larger fonts/scaled UI and there's no visual hint that there might be a link somewhere down below, but that top part of the sidebar is readily visible. If only the field was populated...

@nitzmahone could you edit the about section and paste https://pyyaml.org into the website field so it's discoverable more easily?
